<h2>Domain contacts</h2>
<p>Each domain has four contacts: registrant, administrative, technical and billing. Each form on the domain page replaces one whole contact. The other contacts stay as they are.</p>
<h2>Phone numbers</h2>
<p>Include the country dialing code, separated from the number. For the US and Canada, a ten-digit number also works. Put any extension in Phone extension.</p>
