<h2>Registrant changes</h2>
<p>Changing the registrant can need email verification from the registrar. It can also block transfers to another registrar for 60 days. The Contacts section shows whether verification is waiting and whether that restriction is on.</p>
<h2>Registrar lock</h2>
<p>The registrar lock helps prevent unwanted transfers. Turning it off does not by itself make the domain ready to transfer. The 60-day restriction after a registrant change is separate from the lock.</p>
